WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.080
Have you ever wondered about the deepest&nbsp;
desire of SCP-163, An Old Castaway?

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.500
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.080
to snap a picture of SCP-163 while it was&nbsp;
painting in its habitat. This was the result:

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.680
"Interacting with another member&nbsp;
of its species in an environment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.400
resembling the landscapes in SCP-163's paintings.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:27.700
Notes: A copy of the photograph was printed&nbsp;
in UV-absorbent inks and presented to SCP-163,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.700
who refused to relinquish&nbsp;
the photograph for two days."

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:37.360
SCP-163, like so many who find themselves&nbsp;
in a strange, faraway land, is homesick.

